    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2016_0121","fieldKey":"description"} -->
    <Description>Agnès O'Shaughnessy talks about the long argument with the colour blue. A curator joined for ten minutes and left convinced that the chair was part of the exhibition.</Description>
